# Two editions (docs/plan-two-editions.md): New Game, the opening narration (one shot per page for the
# first pages), then the wake-up and Jian walking out of the inn, a shot every 50 frames with A pressed
# between them. Run once per edition: --rom build/editions/classic.nds / retold.nds.
watch u16 0x020B6BE4 map
watch u32 0x020B6CEC route
wait 1800
touch 40 108 5
wait 300
press A 5
wait 200
wait 600
shot narr_1
press A 3
wait 400
shot narr_2
press A 3
wait 400
